  "result": "Archived issues should no longer show up as cards on the board. I haven't run the test suite or loaded the board to confirm.\n\nThe cause was `listBoardColumns` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. The board page gets its cards from that query, and it filtered by org and project but not by `archivedAt`. The issue list, the counts and the exports all go through queries that already apply the shared archived filter, which is why only the board was affected.\n\nI added `livePredicate(issues.archivedAt, {})` to the query's `where` clause. That's the same filter `countIssues` uses, so the board now follows the same archived-row rule as the rest of the product.",
